#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:4
msgid "v4.8.8"
msgstr "v4.8.8"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.8.8 adds explicit bootloader-entry controls for connecting and updating "
"OpenMV Cams, a per-board safe default for forcing bootloader entry from the "
"\"Install the Latest Development Release\" dialog, and a handful of "
"connection and installer fixes. This release remains based on Qt Creator "
"14.0.2, with no Qt Creator base change and no breaking changes for user "
"projects."
msgstr ""
"v4.8.8 menambahkan kontrol masuk bootloader yang eksplisit untuk "
"menghubungkan dan memperbarui OpenMV Cam, default aman per-board untuk "
"memaksa masuk bootloader dari dialog \"Install the Latest Development "
"Release\", serta sejumlah perbaikan koneksi dan installer. Rilis ini tetap "
"berbasis Qt Creator 14.0.2, tanpa perubahan basis Qt Creator dan tanpa "
"perubahan yang merusak proyek pengguna."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Di halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Force enter OpenMV Cam bootloader** is now available from the ``Tools`` "
"menu, forcing the connected cam into its bootloader on disconnect."
msgstr ""
"**Paksa masuk bootloader OpenMV Cam** kini tersedia dari menu ``Tools``\\ , "
"memaksa kamera yang terhubung masuk ke bootloader-nya saat terputus."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Force bootloader** checkbox added to the ``Install the Latest Development "
"Release`` dialog to force bootloader entry when installing development "
"firmware, with a per-board safe default."
msgstr ""
"Kotak centang **Force bootloader** ditambahkan ke dialog ``Install the "
"Latest Development Release`` untuk memaksa masuk bootloader saat menginstal "
"firmware pengembangan, dengan default aman per-board."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:25
msgid ""
"**DFU-only devices no longer spuriously auto-connect**, since auto-reconnect"
" and board-settings auto-connect now trigger only for normally running "
"boards."
msgstr ""
"**Perangkat khusus DFU tidak lagi terhubung otomatis secara keliru**\\ , "
"karena auto-reconnect dan auto-connect pengaturan board kini hanya aktif "
"untuk board yang berjalan normal."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:27
msgid ""
"**PAG7936 example scripts on the AE3** are auto-rewritten to upscale the "
"``QQVGA`` framesize to ``QVGA`` on load."
msgstr ""
"**Skrip contoh PAG7936 pada AE3** ditulis ulang secara otomatis untuk "
"memperbesar ukuran bingkai ``QQVGA`` menjadi ``QVGA`` saat dimuat."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Installer license handling fixed** so installation proceeds correctly from"
" the Ready-for-Installation page."
msgstr ""
"**Penanganan lisensi installer diperbaiki** sehingga proses instalasi "
"berjalan dengan benar dari halaman Ready-for-Installation."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:33
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Fitur baru"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Force enter OpenMV Cam bootloader.** A new item in the ``Tools`` menu "
"forces the connected cam into its bootloader on disconnect. The ``Install "
"the Latest Development Release`` dialog (reached from the ``Tools`` menu) "
"also gains a **Force bootloader** checkbox to force bootloader entry when "
"installing development firmware. (`350beb306 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/350beb306>`__, `13ca76904 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/13ca76904>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Paksa masuk bootloader OpenMV Cam.** Item baru di menu ``Tools`` memaksa "
"kamera yang terhubung masuk ke bootloader-nya saat terputus. Dialog "
"``Install the Latest Development Release`` (yang dapat diakses dari menu "
"``Tools``\\ ) juga mendapatkan kotak centang **Force bootloader** untuk "
"memaksa masuk bootloader saat menginstal firmware pengembangan. (\\ "
"`350beb306 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/350beb306>`__\\ , "
"`13ca76904 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/13ca76904>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:44
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Perubahan dan peningkatan lainnya"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Per-board force-bootloader default.** The development-release install "
"force-bootloader default is now driven per board via a new "
"``forceBootloaderDefaultSafe`` setting, defaulting on for the AE3 and N6 "
"(96E3/9206) boards and off for older DFU boards to avoid them not auto-"
"exiting the bootloader. (`13ca76904 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/13ca76904>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Default paksa-bootloader per-board.** Default paksa-bootloader pada "
"instalasi rilis pengembangan kini dikendalikan per board melalui pengaturan "
"``forceBootloaderDefaultSafe`` yang baru, aktif secara default untuk board "
"AE3 dan N6 (96E3/9206) dan nonaktif untuk board DFU lama agar tidak gagal "
"keluar otomatis dari bootloader. (\\ `13ca76904 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/13ca76904>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:52
msgid ""
"**PAG7936 framesize upscaling on the AE3.** On the AE3 with the PAG7936 "
"sensor, example scripts are auto-rewritten to upscale the ``QQVGA`` "
"framesize to ``QVGA`` when loaded. (`eed6325f5 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/eed6325f5>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Pembesaran ukuran bingkai PAG7936 pada AE3.** Pada AE3 dengan sensor "
"PAG7936, skrip contoh ditulis ulang secara otomatis untuk memperbesar ukuran"
" bingkai dari ``QQVGA`` menjadi ``QVGA`` saat dimuat. (\\ `eed6325f5 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/eed6325f5>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Non-DFU-only auto-connect.** Auto-reconnect and board-settings auto-"
"connect now trigger only for non-DFU (normally running) boards rather than "
"any present board, so DFU-only devices no longer spuriously auto-connect. "
"(`350beb306 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/350beb306>`__)"
msgstr ""
"**Auto-connect non-DFU saja.** Auto-reconnect dan auto-connect pengaturan "
"board kini hanya aktif untuk board non-DFU (yang berjalan normal), bukan "
"sembarang board yang terdeteksi, sehingga perangkat khusus DFU tidak lagi "
"terhubung otomatis secara keliru. (\\ `350beb306 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/350beb306>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:63
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Perbaikan bug"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:65
msgid ""
"Fixed a typo in the connect-time firmware-update prompt (\"lastest\" -> "
"\"latest release firmware\"). (`13ca76904 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/13ca76904>`__)"
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki kesalahan ketik pada prompt pembaruan firmware saat koneksi "
"(\"lastest\" -> \"latest release firmware\"). (\\ `13ca76904 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/13ca76904>`__\\ )"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.8.rst:68
msgid ""
"Fixed the installer's license-acceptance handling so the install step runs "
"on the Ready-for-Installation page instead of the license-check page, and "
"removed the buggy bundled license file. (`a9d3fb904 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a9d3fb904>`__, `716827f07 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/716827f07>`__)"
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki penanganan penerimaan lisensi pada installer sehingga langkah "
"instalasi berjalan di halaman Ready-for-Installation alih-alih halaman "
"pemeriksaan lisensi, dan menghapus file lisensi bawaan yang bermasalah. (\\ "
"`a9d3fb904 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a9d3fb904>`__\\ , "
"`716827f07 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/716827f07>`__\\ )"

